{"page_id": "olmo_table_tests-105e91a0c9e26af4bb6fc23e13067d596a81_pg1_pg1-p1", "markdown": "SpecSeal® SSP\n\nNON-HARDENING PUTTY\n\nSSP Putty & Putty Pads\n\nSpecSeal® SSP Firestop Putty excels at sealing cabling penetrations and outlet boxes. SSP Putty is non-hardening and easily hand works around grouped cabling penetrations forming a re-enterable seal allowing for future work. When applied to outlet boxes, SSP Putty easily works into voids and seams forming a continuous seal against fire, smoke, and hot gases.\n\nFeatures & Benefits • Available in bars or preformed pads • Remains pliable and workable for the lifetime of the installation • Acoustically tested\n\n• Will not harden over time\n\nDOGSROL | CAT. NO. 88P. FIRESTOP PUTTY PAD\n\nCA. NO\n\nSSP\n\nINTUMESCENT FIRESTOP PUTTY\n\nCatalog Number\n\nSSP100\n\nSSP28\n\nSSP4S\n\nSSP9S\n\nUPC Number\n\n730573021057\n\n730573021019\n\n73057302200\n\n73057302300\n\nSize 36 in? (0.6 liter) bar 24 in? (0.4 liter) bar 7.25\" × 7.25\" × 3/16\" (184 mm x 184 mm × 4.8 mm) pad 9.00\" × 9.00\" × 3/16\" (229 mm × 229 mm × 4.8 mm) pad\n\nTEST STANDARDS: ASTM E814 (UL 1479), CAN/ULC-S115, UL263\n\nRed Color\n\n(EOM) Qty.\n\nCase Qty. 6\n\n20\n\n20\n\nACOUSTICAL\n\nWeight (Each) 2.22 Ibs (1.01 kg) 1.42 Ibs (0.64 kg) 0.64 Ibs (0.29 kg) 0.85 Ibs (0.39 kg)\n\nRe-Enterable Solution\n\nSpecified\n\nSTI. Technologies Inc.\n\n1-800-992-1180 stifirestop.com\n\nMEMBER\n\nClick here to learn more about\n\nSpecSeal SSP\n\nZSTI3535 02020", "width": 1700, "height": 2200, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "SpecSeal® SSP", "bbox": {"x": 95.9, "y": 108.3, "width": 242.9, "height": 214.7}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "NON-HARDENING PUTTY", "bbox": {"x": 814.8, "y": 179.0, "width": 377.10000000000014, "height": 22.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SSP Putty & Putty Pads", "bbox": {"x": 393.0, "y": 236.6, "width": 782.9000000000001, "height": 105.50000000000003}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SpecSeal® SSP Firestop Putty excels at sealing cabling penetrations and outlet boxes. SSP Putty is non-hardening and easily hand works around grouped cabling penetrations forming a re-enterable seal allowing for future work. When applied to outlet boxes, SSP Putty easily works into voids and seams forming a continuous seal against fire, smoke, and hot gases.", "bbox": {"x": 70.3, "y": 450.5, "width": 1533.8, "height": 176.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Features & Benefits • Available in bars or preformed pads • Remains pliable and workable for the lifetime of the installation • Acoustically tested", "bbox": {"x": 67.1, "y": 661.9, "width": 677.4, "height": 163.10000000000002}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "• Will not harden over time", "bbox": {"x": 70.3, "y": 841.0, "width": 278.0, "height": 22.399999999999977}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "DOGSROL | CAT. NO. 88P. FIRESTOP PUTTY PAD", "bbox": {"x": 1254.5, "y": 1104.2, "width": 177.70000000000005, "height": 80.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "CA. NO", "bbox": {"x": 869.2, "y": 1298.0, "width": 89.5, "height": 7.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SSP", "bbox": {"x": 843.3, "y": 1325.4, "width": 221.0, "height": 58.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "INTUMESCENT FIRESTOP PUTTY", "bbox": {"x": 1153.6, "y": 1333.4, "width": 252.4000000000001, "height": 41.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Catalog Number", "bbox": {"x": 86.3, "y": 1467.7, "width": 172.59999999999997, "height": 22.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SSP100", "bbox": {"x": 127.8, "y": 1506.1, "width": 86.3, "height": 25.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SSP28", "bbox": {"x": 134.2, "y": 1547.7, "width": 73.5, "height": 22.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SSP4S", "bbox": {"x": 134.1, "y": 1585.8, "width": 73.70000000000002, "height": 26.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "SSP9S", "bbox": {"x": 137.4, "y": 1627.6, "width": 70.29999999999998, "height": 19.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "UPC Number", "bbox": {"x": 290.8, "y": 1464.5, "width": 140.59999999999997,